export anchor MahoganyDeskStyle:
    number: 400
    screen: EmailClient
    name: Mahogany desk
    idea: A private secretary desk in mahogany and green leather, where the open message lies on a gold tooled blotter in a fountain pen serif and the folders are leather index tabs along its right edge.
    base: dark
    palette:
        mahogany: #22100d, the page
        wood: #301713, the crest bar, index tabs, blotter corners and the style sheet
        woodHigh: #3d1f19, the open correspondence line
        leather: #17291f, the blotter, the current tab and fields
        leatherEdge: #2b4636, the blotter rim
        gold: #d5ad57, tooling lines, the Reply button, the Unread nib, roundels and focus
        goldSoft: #9c7a35, hairlines and button edges
        onGold: #251804, text on gold
        vellum: #f3e9d6, text
        dust: #cdb9a0, subjects and times on wood
        sage: #b9cfbd, meta on leather and notes
    type:
        Two serif stacks. A high contrast pen serif, Bodoni 72, Didot,
        Bodoni MT, Baskerville, Times New Roman, for the brand at 26px, the
        open subject at 42px and the letter at 22px italic with 1.7
        leading. A book serif, Baskerville, Baskerville Old Face, Hoefler
        Text, Garamond, at a 16px base, senders 17px and bold when unread,
        subjects and times in italic, labels 13px spaced caps.
    layout:
        A wood crest bar holds a gold ringed italic B monogram, Brightwork
        with Mail in gold italic, The desk of Mara Okafor in italic and an
        underlined field reading Search correspondence. Below, three parts
        sit side by side. A 340px left column titled Correspondence, Inbox
        lists six lines between gold hairlines, each with a gold roundel of
        italic initials, the sender, the time in italic, the subject and
        snippet in italic and small notes. The Northpass line is shaded and
        its roundel filled gold. The centre is the green leather blotter,
        with two inset gold tooling lines, triangular wood corners at top
        left and bottom right and a deep shadow. On it sit From Dana
        Whitfield, Northpass, to Mara Okafor with the time, the subject in
        the pen serif, a small gold flourish, the letter in italic, a gold
        framed section mark Clients label and square buttons, Reply filled
        gold. Down the right edge hang leather index tabs, Folios then
        Labels, each tab rounded only on its outer side and the current
        Inbox tab in leather with a gold inner bar. Below 1100px the tabs
        become a row under the desk. On a phone the list comes first, then
        the blotter, then the tabs.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 48 by 56px inside the blotter, 14px per correspondence line, a 32px page gutter.
    density: Low. One elegant list, one letter and a column of tabs.
    corners: Square, with triangular wood blotter corners. Index tabs round only their outer corners at 10px.
    borders: 1px gold hairlines between lines and around buttons. The blotter has two inset gold tooling lines.
    shadows: One deep shadow under the blotter and nothing else.
    icons:
        Fine 1.4 stroke. A pen nib plus Unread, a filled star plus Starred,
        a clip plus Enclosure, and a section mark before every label name.
        Senders show italic initials in gold roundels.
    focus: A 2px gold outline offset 3px with a second fine gold ring outside it.
    tone: Formal and courteous, such as Correspondence, Folios, Enclosure and The desk of Mara Okafor.
